/.worktrees

# Archify diagrams (docs/diagramas): only the source (*.<type>.json) is versioned.
# The HTML (~850 KB, viewer included) and the validation artefacts are rebuilt
# locally with ~/.agents/workspace-kit/bin/diagrams.sh.
docs/diagramas/**/*.html
docs/diagramas/**/*.delivery.json
docs/diagramas/**/*.delivery-pending.json
docs/diagramas/**/*.finalize.json
docs/diagramas/**/*.finalize-summary.json
docs/diagramas/**/*.browser-check.json
docs/diagramas/**/*.visual-check.*
docs/diagramas/**/review-*/
docs/diagramas/**/visual-check/
